WEBVTT

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:19.480
On the other side of the wind, it's a war

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:26.720
The day I was born with an endless song

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.970
Nikita Sosa

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:28.500
Thank you for watching!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:30.640
What kind of forest was it?

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:34.210
Did dad stand here and see that sunset?

00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:45.970
Was the sunset he saw so beautiful?

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:20.900
Here? Thank you, here.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:21.660
It's true!

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:25.400
My weather forecast has never been wrong, it's the most popular in the world!

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:29.240
I know, but it's such a beautiful sunset...

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:37.120
I have to get ready, too!

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:40.460
Good night.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:18.900
It's going to be a lot of fun!

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:42.020
Where does that light come from?

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:44.190
I feel like I'm being pulled in.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.700
It's like he's trying to tell me something.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:25.970
My father is calling me again.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:41.650
My father is calling me!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:01.940
Calm down.

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:02.840
Calm down.

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.560
It's over there.

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:29.980
Why am I...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:42.350
It may not be my father's voice, but I should go there, right?

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:07.080
Ah!

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:50.210
It's not the Panja's forest.

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:52.280
I forgot about the fact that Yudan is a bird of prey.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.690
Where should I go?

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:14.450
Dad...

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:46.900
My father is calling me over there.

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:06.070
Hey, it's time to change.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.530
Hey, it's time to change, Uri.

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:08.730
Ouch!

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:10.320
Hey, what are you doing?

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:04.150
This is the village of the business partner this time.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:06.250
I'm sure you'll have a welcome party today.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:09.520
And I haven't seen you before.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:12.100
Maybe you'll show me an important treasure today.

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:16.060
Please cheer up.

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:20.500
I wish I could come here with a new wife, not me.

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:24.330
I wanted to come here with you, dad.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.480
I wanted to come here with him, too.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:38.060
Welcome, I've been waiting for you.

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:39.940
It's been six months since I last saw you.

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:58.660
My father is somewhere.

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:10.290
It's a thank you for making our business go well.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:11.810
Let's have fun.

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:13.470
Thank you.

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:18.890
I'm happy to be alone with this sake.

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:21.930
It's ridiculous.

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:23.190
My throat is burning.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:25.710
Do you want to try a drink?

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:28.610
I'm a minor.

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:37.100
I'll show you something better later.

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:38.520
Look forward to it.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:46.520
Where are you, dad?

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:15.350
Let's take a look at the treasure of the White Guards.

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.290
It's the God of Defense of the Donga.

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:21.400
The God of Defense?

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:26.140
Let's pray for the prosperity of the Donga clan and the good fortune of the Guards.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:39.200
Andy, what should I do with my father?

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.570
Can you tell me?

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:43.140
Don't worry about me.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:54.640
Jungle and Donga's guardian gods are in here.

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:17.830
Where are you, dad?

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.350
Shiroi! Shiroi is back to life!

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:29.550
Huh? What happened?

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:32.880
A white lion child is lurking around!

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.020
A white lion child?

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:38.960
Could it be a white demon child?

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:44.590
Don't kill him!

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.110
I can't let you kill him!

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:47.290
Take him alive!

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:50.060
Demon child...

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:49.980
Wait, Andy. Don't move. Stay still.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:59.300
Don't move!

00:14:00.220 --> 00:14:00.600
Isn't it here?

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:01.900
Search here too.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:02.300
Got it.

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:15.800
My father is certainly here, but...

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:17.360
Where is he?

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:34.040
Father, what is it?

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:16.820
It's a nostalgic smell.

00:15:58.990 --> 00:15:59.230
Thank you for watching!

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:08.160
Andy! Andy, what are you doing? Let's go!

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.050
Oh, yeah.

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:17.820
What's wrong, Andy?

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:20.360
N-nothing.

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:28.360
What's wrong? Is something wrong?

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:29.920
I don't know.

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.740
The children of the demons will come here.

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:37.480
Don't come in.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.950
Wow, this guy is amazing!

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:07.990
Don't shoot!

00:17:08.350 --> 00:17:08.630
Huh?

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:11.450
Stop it, Dad!

00:17:11.850 --> 00:17:12.560
You're a kid.

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:14.960
This lion girl is here to get her father back.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:17.820
Andy...

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:44.460
The guardian of the jungle has come back.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:52.860
Andy, are you all right?

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:53.880
Boss!

00:17:58.440 --> 00:17:59.440
I...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:02.320
It's okay. It's okay, Andy. I know.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:05.810
Don't cry anymore, Andy.

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:23.750
To my father's forest.

00:18:33.800 --> 00:18:34.040
Thank you.

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:03.270
You have to let me die!

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:18.620
Follow me, dad.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:20.250
I'm in Banja's forest.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:23.740
I've always wanted to see you.

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:25.660
I'm Leo, dad.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:45.790
Dad...

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:47.180
This is not the time to cry.

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:50.600
Dad! It's Dad, Leo!

00:19:50.860 --> 00:19:53.800
This is the time to stand up, Leo.

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:56.130
You must live for the jungle and the animals.

00:19:57.390 --> 00:19:58.510
I want you to live.

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:03.730
But dad, I'm worried. I can't be like my dad.

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:08.380
I always fail and make everyone lose their way.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:12.700
Don't be afraid, Leo. You are my only son.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.490
Believe in yourself.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:19.940
That's right, Leo. You are not Panja no Mori, but Leo no Mori.

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.200
Dad, thank you.

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:28.170
But my dad's Panja no Mori is what my friends in the forest love.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.660
So I...

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.140
I want to protect Panja's forest with everyone.

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:35.740
My power is small, so I want to protect it with my friends.

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:39.440
Leo, you've become a great man.

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:43.940
Even if I'm not here, you're the king of the jungle.

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:45.150
I want you.

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:46.640
Dad...

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.410
I'm counting on you, Leo.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:49.930
I'm counting on you.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.100
Wait, Dad!

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:15.620
Thank you for watching.

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:49.940
I, Panja, will be with everyone in this Panja forest from now on!

00:21:50.020 --> 00:21:58.780
Father, please watch over me from above...

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.680
Please watch us for a long time and see what kind of forest we will build!

00:23:04.156 --> 00:23:05.516
Kirin no Ko! Lulua!

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:07.480
I can't take my eyes off it.

00:23:07.996 --> 00:23:09.336
It's been a while since I came back.

00:23:09.468 --> 00:23:10.648
Mew is a coward.

00:23:10.844 --> 00:23:12.324
to take care of Ruru.

00:23:13.468 --> 00:23:16.468
Next time on Jungle Taitei, Chapter 38.

00:23:16.636 --> 00:23:17.356
See you!

00:23:18.012 --> 00:23:18.512
Mew!

00:23:18.748 --> 00:23:19.848
I'll leave it to you, Lulu.

00:24:01.690 --> 00:24:01.990
Bungie!
